{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 37","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/0/1e0446a8d259507d5fc65226fe54c0b217e8ce04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_1, P_2,\\cdots,P_7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"108\" height=\"16\" /> on a straight line, in the order stated (not necessarily evenly spaced). \nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be an arbitrarily selected point on the line and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be the sum of the undirected lengths\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/6/6065247cce6720cd97ffb32f2289a1d004ed8a5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PP_1, PP_2, \\cdots , PP_7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"150\" height=\"16\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is smallest if and only if the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/5/975ea01a1cb7d2be61e4e8257ed5693a209d8f27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{midway between }P_1\\text{ and }P_7\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{midway between }P_2\\text{ and }P_6\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{midway between }P_3\\text{ and }P_5\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{at }P_4 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{at }P_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"235\" height=\"77\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle_Inequality\" title=\"Triangle Inequality\">Triangle Inequality</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/6/456d81e51ff59ee7fcfec2ea2e53c7d6af41a218.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_1P + P_7P \\ge P_1P_7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"150\" height=\"15\" />, with equality happening when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b0256a78d58b6d5f7a53400b19e7747d2983fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/4/bd404c07b0b0414e3b2cf6b80554ff87b9c3f4c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" />. Using similar logic, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> must be between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/9/9090f2e6bd5da465fea10a8c755d64e9185f61f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/1/63103f61ea87d78047bf2b5be31547472b6af3ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> in order for the distance to be minimized.\n</p><p>The only point left to deal with is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/4/d6467cab96a8b0fa5724824ac7d13187e9a84c31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" /> (which is also between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/9/9090f2e6bd5da465fea10a8c755d64e9185f61f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/1/63103f61ea87d78047bf2b5be31547472b6af3ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" />).  The minimum possible distance is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> (when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/4/d6467cab96a8b0fa5724824ac7d13187e9a84c31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" />), so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1963\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">Problem 36</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">Problem 38</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\